Schrute profiles, but you can find all of us on LinkedIn.
施鲁特的档案，但你能在领英上找到我们所有人。

987
00:44:00.430 --> 00:44:01.330
I love that.
我太喜欢了。

988
00:44:01.770 --> 00:44:08.850
You are very right, Angela, when you say that Michael is very furious to find out that Charles
安吉拉，你说得太对了，迈克尔发现查尔斯

