He does this thing, as my dad would say, he went in there wide open.
正如我爸会说的那样，他这叫毫无保留地直冲进去。

991
00:44:16.610 --> 00:44:20.830
Oh, that was an expression my dad would say, which meant here comes hell.
哦，那是我爸常用的一句俗语，意思是麻烦要来了。

992
00:44:20.910 --> 00:44:21.410
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

