00:45:15.840 --> 00:45:16.880
That's the other thing that I think.
这是我的另一个想法。

1021
00:45:16.880 --> 00:45:17.620
He sounds like Rain.
他听起来像雷恩。

1022
00:45:17.620 --> 00:45:19.040
He does sound like Rain.
他听起来确实像雷恩。

1023
00:45:19.120 --> 00:45:20.780
I think that kind of cracked Rain up.
我觉得这大概把雷恩逗笑了。

