And he keeps looking over his shoulder.
他一直回头张望。

1038
00:46:00.280 --> 00:46:01.420
And Charles is there.
查尔斯就在那里。

1039
00:46:02.180 --> 00:46:02.580
Yes.
没错。

1040
00:46:02.940 --> 00:46:04.960
Looking at him through the blinds of the conference room.
透过会议室的百叶窗看着他。

1041
00:46:05.100 --> 00:46:06.860
And then it pans to Jim.
然后镜头移向吉姆。

1042
00:46:07.040 --> 00:46:09.200
And Jim, like, shakes off the camera, like, mm-mm, mm-mm.
吉姆对着镜头摆了摆手，像是在说“不不，不不”。

1043
00:46:09.320 --> 00:46:11.100
And then it whips over to Dwight.
接着镜头猛地转向德怀特。

1044
00:46:11.120 --> 00:46:12.780
And Dwight is so smug and happy.
德怀特显得无比自鸣得意、开心快活。

1045
00:46:13.160 --> 00:46:16.000
Well, in the script, Dwight had a talking head here.
在剧本里，德怀特在这里有一段独白镜头。

