Charles got lunch for everybody.
查尔斯给大家买午饭了。

1060
00:46:43.320 --> 00:46:44.060
People are thrilled.
大家都兴奋极了。

1061
00:46:44.360 --> 00:46:46.500
Michael's like, uh, I wish you would have told us sooner.
迈克尔的反应是，呃，我要是早点知道就好了。

1062
00:46:46.500 --> 00:46:49.140
I was going to go to the vending machine and get an egg salad.
我本打算去自动售货机买个鸡蛋沙拉的。

1063
00:46:49.480 --> 00:46:50.180
